  "Where downloads go": "Adónde van las descargas",
  "Where films and episodes are written. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Dónde se escriben las películas y los episodios. Los torrents ya descargados se quedan donde están.",
  "Where to keep downloads": "Dónde guardar las descargas",
  "Which copy to reach for when Ventic picks one for you. It is a preference and not a filter: a tier with nothing worth streaming in it falls through to the next, so asking for 4K on a title that has none still plays the best 1080p.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: Which copy to reach for when Ventic picks one for you. It is a preference and not a filter: a tier with nothing worth streaming in it falls through to the next, so asking for 4K on a title that has none still plays the best 1080p.",
  "Which drive films and episodes are written to — a plugged-in stick usually holds far more than the box itself. Uninstalling the app still removes them. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "En qué unidad se escriben las películas y los episodios: un pendrive conectado suele caber mucho más que la propia caja. Desinstalar la aplicación los elimina igualmente. Los torrents ya descargados se quedan donde están.",
  "Worth turning on wherever the app feels heavy — a television or a set-top box most of all, where the graphics chip is a fraction of a laptop's.": "Vale la pena activarlo allí donde la aplicación se sienta pesada: sobre todo en un televisor o un decodificador, donde el chip gráfico es una fracción del de un portátil.",
